== Latin ==
=== Etymology ===
Literally ''an assumption from the beginning,'' from a [[calque]] of the Greek [[τὸ ἐν ἀρχῇ αἰτεῖσθαι]] ''(to en archē aetīsthae,'' to assume from the beginning).

